who_they_are: A woman who already knows what a French pedicure looks like and wants it on her own toes — either before an event/vacation or as an ongoing at-home routine to skip salon cost. Beginner-to-intermediate DIY nail skill level; not asking "what is this" but "how do I actually do this without it looking amateur."
